# Configuration for {{app name}}. Copy to .env and fill in local values. Never commit real secrets.
#
# WEB, MOBILE AND DESKTOP APPS: every value here is built into what users download and is
# PUBLIC. Only put public values here (API base URL, public analytics key). Secrets
# belong in a server-side app.
#
# Document every variable in this format:
#   # <What it is>. Required|Optional (default: <value>). Public|Secret. Source: <where to get it>.
#   NAME=<safe example value>

# Example — replace or delete:
# # Base URL of the API. Required. Public. Source: local api app or DEPLOYMENT.md environments.
# API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
